{
  "slug": "chana-masala-brown-rice",
  "name": "Chana masala with brown rice",
  "description": "Canned chickpeas simmered with onion, garlic and tomato in toasted cumin and chili powder, then folded through cooked brown rice for an easy weeknight dinner.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Warm the canola oil in a wide pan over medium heat and cook the onion until soft and golden, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, ground cumin and chili powder, and stir for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the tomato and cook until it breaks down and thickens, about 4 minutes.",
    "Add the chickpeas and simmer for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until they are glossy and well coated.",
    "Fold the cooked brown rice through the pan and finish with the cilantro just before serving."
  ],
